Subject: [PATCH] Seam: phaseHostTM_run through the last-phase lemma and
 published equations

The two new lemmas move above phaseHostTM_run, whose window up to T is now
phaseHostTM_run_le (it was the same proof inline). Its dispatch step is read
through MultiTapeTM.step_of_some, the host's table at the redirected exit
and the field equations of Action.apply and Cfg.mapState, instead of
unfolding MultiTapeTM.step and Cfg.mapState. Its statement is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
